    "sub": "We introduce a novel method for reconstructing the cosmic mass, tidal, and velocity fields over the redshift range $0 < z < 0.6$ using the phase information of galaxy groups.",
    "sub_pt": "We introduce a novel method for reconstructing the cosmic mass, tidal, and velocity fields over the redshift range $0 < z < 0.6$ using the phase information of galaxy groups.",
    "sub_en": "We introduce a novel method for reconstructing the cosmic mass, tidal, and velocity fields over the redshift range $0 < z < 0.6$ using the phase information of galaxy groups.",
    "excerpt": "We introduce a novel method for reconstructing the cosmic mass, tidal, and velocity fields over the redshift range $0 < z < 0.6$ using the phase information of galaxy groups.",
